WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Standing LP deliberately misses before raw Rush.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.150
Marisa Rushes toward the waking Ryu.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.700
Rush crouching LK hits Ryu low.

4
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.100
Back HP continues the normal-hit low conversion.

5
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:03.950
